WEBVTT

00:05.440 --> 00:09.230
<i>Shinobu chin has... completely stopped coming over.</i>

00:12.160 --> 00:13.580
<i>What could be the reason!?</i>

00:14.170 --> 00:16.360
<i>He never had any intention of going out with me to begin with?</i>

00:17.070 --> 00:18.760
<i>Was he satisfied with just going out?</i>

00:19.600 --> 00:21.680
<i>He tried going out with me but got tired of it?</i>

00:21.680 --> 00:23.620
Takatsuki
Shinobu

00:25.700 --> 00:30.280
<i>"I love you", "I've fallen for you", "It's destiny". Just who was it ranting about all that!?</i>

00:34.170 --> 00:36.160
I need to have a damn drink!

00:39.900 --> 00:43.030
<i>Is he trying to turn me into a cabbage man?</i>

00:46.620 --> 00:48.710
<i>He's still as awkward as ever.</i>

00:49.700 --> 00:53.700
<i>And to be honest, his cabbage stir fry still tastes as bad as ever,</i>

00:55.040 --> 00:57.040
<i>and he's aware of that himself...</i>

00:58.600 --> 01:00.600
<i>and is still trying his best to make it.</i>

01:01.550 --> 01:02.640
How's the taste?

01:03.390 --> 01:08.910
<i>Though he forces it on me pompously, he watches with nervousness to see my reaction.</i>

01:10.660 --> 01:12.270
Oh! It's delicious.

01:12.950 --> 01:13.650
Really!?

01:14.140 --> 01:14.710
Yeah.

01:15.150 --> 01:16.960
It's the best one you've made so far.

01:18.930 --> 01:20.980
Don't make fun of me!

01:21.560 --> 01:22.130
<i>Well...</i>

01:22.930 --> 01:27.530
<i>I always pretended not it see it purposely, acted like I didn't notice.</i>

01:28.700 --> 01:32.590
<i>I may not look it, but I do pay attention to people.</i>

01:33.680 --> 01:35.920
<i>Hasn't that idiot realised it yet?</i>

01:38.440 --> 01:40.120
<i>I'm seriously angry now.</i>

01:40.370 --> 01:43.390
<i>This seem as if I'm madly in love with him.</i>

01:45.000 --> 01:47.040
Madly in love?

01:48.220 --> 01:50.570
"Madly in love", what the hell!!?

01:51.000 --> 01:56.010
Love does not follow logic

01:56.310 --> 02:01.560
Afuredashita shoudou ga bokura no mune wo ustu

01:56.310 --> 02:01.560
An overflowing urge moves our hearts

01:59.260 --> 02:12.530
Junjou Romantica 2

02:01.560 --> 02:05.030
ima futari no story

02:01.560 --> 02:05.030
Now, our story...

02:06.320 --> 02:13.810
bokura no mirai ga kagayaite yuku yo

02:06.320 --> 02:13.810
Our future is going to shine on.

02:17.250 --> 02:22.540
mae ni susumeba dareka to butsukatte

02:17.250 --> 02:22.540
If I try to move forward, I collide with someone else,

02:23.010 --> 02:27.370
okubyou ni naru bakari

02:23.010 --> 02:27.370
and always lose my nerve.

02:27.370 --> 02:32.970
dakedo mae wo muite aruite iku yo

02:27.370 --> 02:32.970
But I'm going to face front and walk ahead,

02:32.970 --> 02:36.600
kimi to aeru nara

02:32.970 --> 02:36.600
if it means I can see you.

02:38.630 --> 02:43.610
ame ni utarete furueru koe

02:38.630 --> 02:43.610
Your trembling voice, pelted by the rain,

02:43.940 --> 02:49.210
nemurenu yoru wo samayottemo

02:43.940 --> 02:49.210
even if I have to wander sleepless nights,

02:49.890 --> 02:52.690
boku wa yuku yo

02:49.890 --> 02:52.690
I'll go,

02:52.690 --> 02:59.440
kimi to deaeru sono hima de

02:52.690 --> 02:59.440
Until the day when I can see you.

03:00.260 --> 03:05.450
Afuredashita shoudou ga bokura no mune wo ustu

03:00.260 --> 03:05.450
An overflowing urge moves our hearts

03:05.450 --> 03:09.160
ima futari no story

03:05.450 --> 03:09.160
Now, our story

03:09.320 --> 03:10.970
ugokidashita

03:09.320 --> 03:10.970
has started.

03:10.970 --> 03:15.960
meguriatta shougeki de iro no nai sekai ga

03:10.970 --> 03:15.960
The impact of our meeting, shocked this dull, grey world

03:15.960 --> 03:23.150
isshun de azayaka ni irozuite yuku yo

03:15.960 --> 03:23.150
and instantly burst into a brilliant color.

03:30.810 --> 03:32.240
Hello, Takatsuki here.

03:32.590 --> 03:36.990
Ah- I... I mean... It's Miyagi...

03:37.290 --> 03:39.660
Yes... What? What happened?

03:40.550 --> 03:44.620
Um... if your lovely brother is available... I'd like to talk to him.

03:45.280 --> 03:46.400
Please wait a bit.

03:48.140 --> 03:50.580
<i>I forgot that my ex-wife might answer the phone.</i>

03:53.460 --> 03:54.540
Hello.

03:55.280 --> 03:58.990
Shinobu's not here... is what he told himself.

04:00.520 --> 04:01.450
Did something happen?

04:02.410 --> 04:04.220
O-Oh nothing.

04:04.880 --> 04:05.890
Sorry about that.

04:06.450 --> 04:07.020
Bye.

04:07.400 --> 04:11.290
By the way, Shinobu kept pestering me with questions the other day.

04:11.530 --> 04:12.160
Hmm?

04:12.480 --> 04:14.930
Did you show <i>that</i> photo to Shinobu?

04:16.100 --> 04:17.040
Photo?

04:17.600 --> 04:18.240
Of what?

04:18.850 --> 04:19.640
Doesn't matter.

04:20.160 --> 04:20.720
Bye then.

04:23.720 --> 04:24.680
Photo?

04:25.510 --> 04:26.260
What was that?

04:27.080 --> 04:28.270
I didn't show any...

04:31.240 --> 04:33.280
Huh? Where is it?

04:34.120 --> 04:35.160
Let's see...

04:39.730 --> 04:41.030
This one huh?

04:55.300 --> 04:57.050
J-Just kidding...!

04:57.900 --> 05:00.260
Today... is it okay if I stay?

05:01.150 --> 05:01.860
No.

05:02.500 --> 05:03.980
Your parents will worry.

05:04.600 --> 05:05.210
Here.

05:06.730 --> 05:08.430
I'll drive you to the station.

05:09.770 --> 05:11.130
Go on ahead to the car.

05:12.590 --> 05:13.720
Sorry, sorry!

05:14.500 --> 05:18.210
The used bookstore called up and I got a little caught up in the conversation.

05:19.150 --> 05:20.190
I'll go home by myself.

05:20.640 --> 05:21.130
Huh?

05:21.790 --> 05:22.700
Hey, Shinobu!

05:24.800 --> 05:25.880
<i>Ever since then...</i>

05:27.550 --> 05:29.110
Is he an idiot!?

05:29.840 --> 05:33.570
<i>Now that I know what's up, I'll catch him at school and confront him about it...</i>

05:34.120 --> 05:37.440
<i>Wait, tomorrow's Saturday, so there's no school.</i>

05:38.620 --> 05:40.480
<i>What's this circle for?</i>

05:45.370 --> 05:48.680
<i>Every year, on this day of this month, without fail,</i>

05:49.320 --> 05:51.490
<i>I go back to my hometown and visit Sensei's grave.</i>

05:54.620 --> 05:59.420
<i>It had totally become a part of my regular routine, so I should never have forgotten about it, yet...</i>

06:00.340 --> 06:01.360
<i>...I forgot.</i>

06:04.170 --> 06:04.870
<i>Why is that?</i>

06:06.480 --> 06:08.470
<i>Why, about such an important thing...?</i>

06:10.080 --> 06:10.940
<i>...did I forget?</i>

06:19.440 --> 06:21.670
<i>I hardly slept at all last night.</i>

06:22.300 --> 06:24.220
<i>This is all </i>his <i>fault.</i>

06:32.260 --> 06:33.200
Hey, Shinobu!

06:37.080 --> 06:38.910
What's up with that foreigner?

06:37.560 --> 06:41.200
Did you see Panda v/s Beard Panda on TV last night?

06:41.460 --> 06:44.680
Yeah! I was rolling on the floor laughing!

06:45.430 --> 06:46.330
Shinobu!!

06:48.960 --> 06:49.720
Hey!

06:49.760 --> 06:51.030
Hey, wait you!!

06:51.750 --> 06:53.160
That bastard...!

06:55.280 --> 06:57.420
<i>And he never once smiled at me...</i>

06:58.560 --> 07:00.730
<i>...but is giggling all over his friend!</i>

07:02.920 --> 07:04.850
<i>Isn't this just perfect!</i>

07:05.530 --> 07:07.510
<i>You want to breakup? You got it!</i>

07:08.030 --> 07:10.240
<i>Your next partner is some foreigner, eh!?</i>

07:10.490 --> 07:14.190
<i>Ah, yes, yes! You look perfect together! Good for you!!</i>

07:14.440 --> 07:17.600
<i>Before I call it quits, I'll even let you make excuses. </i>

07:17.890 --> 07:19.380
<i>You should be grateful!</i>

07:20.360 --> 07:23.050
<i>Because, I'm a mature, sensible adult, you see,</i>

07:24.000 --> 07:28.740
<i>so I'll deal with this whole matter nice and rationally!</i>

07:29.340 --> 07:31.020
<i>Because I'm an adult...!</i>

07:33.630 --> 07:35.510
<i>I have got to calm down.</i>

07:37.040 --> 07:43.600
<i>A good adult taken for a ride by a little kid... it's just so unsightly.</i>

07:45.700 --> 07:50.120
<i>What came as a shock was... that I completely forgot about Sensei.</i>

07:51.280 --> 07:59.520
<i>No... to the point that I couldn't spare a thought for Sensei... I was thinking about Shinobu...</i>

08:01.820 --> 08:02.560
Huh?

08:04.220 --> 08:05.000
A suspicious person.

08:05.470 --> 08:07.180
Whose fault do you think this is!?

08:07.550 --> 08:08.500
Who's that?

08:08.870 --> 08:11.610
You don't have to know. Get in my house.

08:11.880 --> 08:12.540
Uh-huh.

08:14.500 --> 08:15.720
Let go!

08:15.910 --> 08:19.240
If you give me a satisfactory explanation, I'll let go of you.

08:19.410 --> 08:22.560
I said, it's none of your business, didn't I!?

08:23.000 --> 08:23.860
Is this it!?

08:26.380 --> 08:27.640
Are you an idiot?

08:28.520 --> 08:30.720
Don't jump to conclusions as you wish.

08:31.250 --> 08:35.370
I told you before, didnt I? She was my homeroom teacher from high school.

08:36.200 --> 08:37.600
That's all this photo is.

08:38.120 --> 08:39.320
Liar!

08:39.520 --> 08:42.470
Then why have you been treasuring it for all this time?

08:42.550 --> 08:43.200
What?

08:43.530 --> 08:45.000
I heard from my sister.

08:45.760 --> 08:51.670
And you're never really particular about anything, not even your own belongings.

08:52.000 --> 08:57.350
Still that photo is the one thing you cherish and look at, that's not normal, right!?

08:58.430 --> 09:01.560
Not normal? What are you trying to say?

09:02.640 --> 09:04.550
It's just some damn photo!

09:05.360 --> 09:07.320
That's what pisses me off!

09:08.100 --> 09:12.700
If the person I like keeps a photo of their homeroom teacher with them, I would naturally be bothered!

09:16.780 --> 09:19.740
You've been sulking over something ridiculous like that all this time?

09:20.670 --> 09:22.000
This is why kids are...

09:24.100 --> 09:26.240
Hey! What the hell are you doing?

09:26.380 --> 09:27.470
Screw you!

09:28.620 --> 09:31.140
Stop being all cool and composed about it!

09:31.750 --> 09:34.810
It might not mean a damn thing for you, but...

09:35.710 --> 09:37.530
...for me it's...!

09:38.230 --> 09:39.220
To me it's...

09:40.690 --> 09:44.320
You agreed to go out with me just to shut me up, didn't you?

09:44.930 --> 09:46.510
I don't need that!

09:47.080 --> 09:50.380
I've always being thinking about what I'm lacking all this time.

09:50.920 --> 09:54.220
But even if I wanted to fix it, I didn't even understand what is it that I was lacking!

09:54.460 --> 09:56.240
I don't even know what to do!

09:56.340 --> 09:59.800
From your point of view, it might seem as something ridiculous,

10:00.440 --> 10:02.300
but it's important for me!

10:02.430 --> 10:06.380
Don't just dismiss it all away by saying that I'm a kid or I'm young!

10:17.370 --> 10:20.480
Bastard... you just don't get it, do you?

10:21.390 --> 10:24.750
Just how much I love you...

10:31.200 --> 10:32.430
What are you doing!?

10:35.380 --> 10:36.390
Shinobu!

10:38.430 --> 10:39.460
Miyagi!!

10:41.710 --> 10:43.000
Not to worry!

10:43.180 --> 10:45.040
He'll be with me for a while!

10:45.410 --> 10:46.320
Hey!!

10:48.520 --> 10:49.880
What the hell are you doing!?

10:50.070 --> 10:53.160
Idiot!! Abducting me like that!!

11:04.400 --> 11:05.700
What was that for...?

11:07.190 --> 11:09.240
It's going to be a long drive.

11:38.300 --> 11:39.920
Hey, wake up.

11:46.240 --> 11:48.240
Where is this again?

11:48.900 --> 11:49.750
Let's go.

11:51.350 --> 11:52.440
Huh...?

11:53.760 --> 11:55.590
What is this place?

11:57.030 --> 11:58.960
Hey... Miyagi!!

12:08.850 --> 12:10.060
Let go of me!

12:10.280 --> 12:13.870
Stop kidding! This is <i>her</i> grave, isn't it!?

12:14.090 --> 12:17.630
What's the meaning of this!? Dragging me to a place like this!

12:20.440 --> 12:24.060
Sensei... I... love this person!

12:30.020 --> 12:31.220
W-What!?

12:31.440 --> 12:32.620
What's with you, bastard?

12:33.260 --> 12:34.440
What did you just say?

12:34.770 --> 12:40.710
I was thinking so much about him that I forgot about your death anniversary this year.

12:41.710 --> 12:44.410
Something like this hasn't happened till now...

12:44.700 --> 12:46.860
even though I thought that something like this is impossible.

12:48.620 --> 12:52.740
Since you died, I've had my share of relationships.

12:53.830 --> 12:59.310
I even got married once, but in the end I just couldn't forget you, and so we got divorced.

13:00.400 --> 13:05.580
I kept thinking that from now onwards, I'll think of only Sensei for the rest of my life.

13:07.390 --> 13:08.410
But please forgive me.

13:09.640 --> 13:11.930
I've found someone other than Sensei.

13:13.620 --> 13:19.840
He's loud, troublesome, awkward and on top of that a little brat...

13:19.930 --> 13:21.230
Shut up!

13:21.900 --> 13:29.010
But... I realized that he is someone I can't help but think as really adorable.

13:30.640 --> 13:33.050
Sensei, it's laughable, right?

13:33.680 --> 13:39.280
That someone like me, could end up this way, I never saw it coming.

13:41.720 --> 13:43.390
<i>Will you forgive me?</i>

13:45.540 --> 13:46.470
Miyagi.

13:47.440 --> 13:51.080
You must forget about me after I die.

13:51.650 --> 13:54.880
What are you saying!? Stop kidding!

13:55.840 --> 13:57.700
Don't say that, even as a joke!

13:58.350 --> 14:00.580
Would I joke about this, idiot?

14:02.200 --> 14:03.400
Stop it!

14:03.950 --> 14:04.650
I...

14:05.230 --> 14:10.800
I... want you to be happy.

14:11.470 --> 14:16.710
That's why, before my existence becomes a burden for you, I want you to forget me.

14:19.040 --> 14:22.800
I wonder if you can understand, these fine subtleties of a girl's heart.

14:23.200 --> 14:26.240
Ofcourse I don't understand something like that!

14:27.130 --> 14:29.360
Miyagi, I love you.

14:30.240 --> 14:34.120
I want you to always keep looking forward.

14:36.160 --> 14:40.780
<i>If I took a step forward, I wonder what would be lying ahead.</i>

14:41.990 --> 14:46.240
<i>It may be something I'll come to regret terribly.</i>

14:48.110 --> 14:51.780
<i>But even so, I want to be able to accept it.</i>

14:53.520 --> 14:55.840
<i>To rise above it.</i>

14:57.700 --> 15:02.270
<i>Sensei... is it alright if I take a step forward now?</i>

15:05.680 --> 15:06.730
<i>Sensei...</i>

15:07.590 --> 15:12.300
<i>I really loved you a lot.</i>

15:13.310 --> 15:14.520
Thank you very much.

15:18.810 --> 15:19.750
Miyagi.

15:21.560 --> 15:23.530
Um... I...

15:24.020 --> 15:25.040
Oh...

15:26.780 --> 15:29.010
You're Miyagi-kun... aren't you?

15:30.050 --> 15:31.410
It's been a long time.

15:33.100 --> 15:34.100
Thank you.

15:34.830 --> 15:40.240
It's you whose been offering flowers every year, isn't it?

15:42.830 --> 15:44.100
It's enough now.

15:45.000 --> 15:47.700
Though I'm happy that you still care for her.

15:49.010 --> 15:51.190
This year will be the last.

16:03.000 --> 16:07.740
Miyagi, thank you for loving me.

16:10.390 --> 16:13.270
<i>Gentle, gentle words.</i>

16:13.840 --> 16:16.260
<i>I could do nothing but cry.</i>

16:18.280 --> 16:20.480
<i>Then too, now too.</i>

16:30.230 --> 16:33.140
Sensei was my homeroom teacher in high school.

16:33.950 --> 16:39.400
At that time, I was in the prime of my young punk phase, rebelling against Sensei.

16:40.370 --> 16:42.070
Now that I look back on it,

16:42.840 --> 16:45.110
I must have been in love with her from the start.

16:45.760 --> 16:47.320
A common story.

16:48.240 --> 16:49.170
Childish, isn't it?

16:49.740 --> 16:56.640
And I ended up just squawking on and on to her about how I'd fallen for her and how I loved her and what not...

16:58.080 --> 16:59.180
But you were serious about her.

17:00.010 --> 17:01.860
Yeah, that's right.

17:04.400 --> 17:05.040
What's the matter?

17:08.520 --> 17:09.140
Hey!

17:12.740 --> 17:14.290
What is it, Shinobu?

17:15.450 --> 17:18.540
I can't go out with you afterall.

17:18.980 --> 17:19.750
Huh?

17:20.180 --> 17:22.580
Where you even listening to what I was saying?

17:23.710 --> 17:27.240
But I can't win against Sensei.

17:27.440 --> 17:28.040
Huh?

17:28.490 --> 17:29.300
Isn't that so?

17:29.430 --> 17:34.640
She had so much to give you, and you were in love with her too.

17:35.490 --> 17:41.530
But, I have my hands full just trying to take care of myself and always cause trouble for you.

17:41.800 --> 17:42.970
What are you saying?

17:43.020 --> 17:44.610
I understand now.

17:45.320 --> 17:52.040
What I'm doing is egocentric, selfish, and looking from other's point of view, might look ridiculous.

17:52.870 --> 17:53.480
Hey.

17:53.610 --> 17:54.620
Even so...!

17:55.920 --> 18:01.660
Then what should I do to be able to act smart, cool and calm like an adult?

18:01.910 --> 18:03.550
Shinobu, calm down!

18:04.230 --> 18:07.430
How can I get you to look back at me?

18:07.900 --> 18:11.160
Always, I've always been thinking about that!

18:11.730 --> 18:14.280
But I can't find the answer!

18:14.910 --> 18:18.930
I'm so desperate, so selfish and really embarrassed by myself!

18:19.690 --> 18:24.630
Even so! This is all I know how to do!

18:25.720 --> 18:27.730
Will I understand it when I become older?

18:28.660 --> 18:31.600
If that's so, just how many years should I wait?

18:32.400 --> 18:34.290
How can I become mature?

18:35.480 --> 18:37.660
How should I win against Sensei?

18:39.130 --> 18:42.570
How should I close this gap of 17 years?

18:43.510 --> 18:47.670
What should I do... to bring myself closer to you?

18:53.970 --> 18:56.680
Do you really want to breakup up with me so badly?

18:58.300 --> 18:59.560
You don't, right?

19:00.500 --> 19:03.150
You really are such a kid, aren't you?

19:04.030 --> 19:08.010
If it bothers you that much, I'll just forget about her.

19:08.730 --> 19:10.000
No!

19:10.600 --> 19:12.160
But just now you...

19:12.570 --> 19:16.240
It's not that! You shouldn't forget about something like that!

19:16.560 --> 19:19.740
Don't you forget about something that important!

19:20.360 --> 19:22.840
Then, what is it!?

19:27.540 --> 19:30.400
That much even I understand.

19:31.340 --> 19:32.280
I understand.

19:33.090 --> 19:33.730
Still...

19:35.050 --> 19:37.600
"I'll try falling in love" just isn't enough.

19:38.540 --> 19:40.230
I'm selfish,

19:41.320 --> 19:44.150
but I'll try my very best.

19:45.390 --> 19:50.170
That's why, I really want you to fall in love with me.

19:51.240 --> 19:52.300
And then,

19:53.720 --> 19:58.720
you have to care for me more than anyone else.

20:01.210 --> 20:04.210
<i>Though he's lecturing me, he's just a coward.</i>

20:06.510 --> 20:09.880
<i>He has a bad attitude, but he blushes right up to his ears.</i>

20:11.040 --> 20:13.970
<i>Always, always thinking of only me...</i>

20:16.350 --> 20:20.800
<i>How could I possibly not find him adorable?</i>

20:21.820 --> 20:22.850
Hey, look.

20:24.310 --> 20:27.150
What the hell did you hear when we were in the cemetery?

20:27.890 --> 20:30.160
I said I love you.

20:31.110 --> 20:32.880
I said you're my number one.

20:33.380 --> 20:34.640
Got a problem with that?

20:42.480 --> 20:45.840
You really do cry like a real man, don't you?

21:00.740 --> 21:01.530
Miyagi...

21:02.220 --> 21:03.110
I love you.

21:03.500 --> 21:04.600
I know.

21:05.000 --> 21:06.580
I've known that from the beginning.

21:18.840 --> 21:23.980
Yokogiru dake wa ichinichi no owari ni

21:18.840 --> 21:23.980
Crossing paths at the end of the day,

21:24.110 --> 21:29.370
itsu kara ka kimi ga sakimawari shite matte ite

21:24.110 --> 21:29.370
at some point you went up ahead and waited for me.

21:29.720 --> 21:34.740
ureshii kimochi bai ni shite kurete

21:29.720 --> 21:34.740
You doubled all my happiness,

21:34.740 --> 21:41.430
kanamishi kimochi hanbun ni shite kureru kara

21:34.740 --> 21:41.430
and halved all my sadness.

21:41.540 --> 21:46.540
kore kara donna michi aruitemo

21:41.540 --> 21:46.540
No matter what path I walk in the future,

21:46.940 --> 21:51.220
kitto sore wa kimi he to tsuzuiteru

21:46.940 --> 21:51.220
will surely lead to you.

21:51.220 --> 21:53.980
boku no saki ni wa kimi ga ite

21:51.220 --> 21:53.980
You're there up ahead of me,

21:53.980 --> 21:56.840
kimi no saki ni wa boka ga iru

21:53.980 --> 21:56.840
I'm there ahead of you,

21:56.840 --> 22:02.110
hoka no dare mo inai futari dake no basho

21:56.840 --> 22:02.110
A place for just the two of us with no one else around.

22:02.110 --> 22:08.010
sore ga boku no subete nanda sore ga boku wo karuku shiteru na

22:02.110 --> 22:08.010
That's my everything, and lifts the weight off my shoulders.

22:08.600 --> 22:13.080
mou doko he mo ikanaide

22:08.600 --> 22:13.080
Hey, don't go anywhere.

22:13.080 --> 22:18.540
yakusoku no basho wa itsumo hidamari no kaori wo sasete

22:13.080 --> 22:18.540
Our promised place always has the smell of sunshine.

22:18.540 --> 22:23.930
boku no ashimoto wo terashiteirunda

22:18.540 --> 22:23.930
It's casting a light at my feet.

22:23.930 --> 22:29.750
kimi no koto ga suki da yotte to ieru boku ga suki dakara

22:23.930 --> 22:29.750
I love myself being able to say "I love you!"

22:30.140 --> 22:35.430
mune no oku de sotto arigatou

22:30.140 --> 22:35.430
Softly in my heart I say, "Thank you."

22:40.710 --> 22:45.750
Nonetheless, not being able to sit is such a cute, innocent reaction.

22:46.360 --> 22:48.320
Shut up!! It's because of you!

22:48.480 --> 22:54.510
By the way, not that it matters, but who was that foreigner who was with you?

22:55.600 --> 22:57.520
He's a friend from Australia.

22:58.040 --> 22:59.690
He just came for a visit.

23:00.670 --> 23:01.440
Why?

23:01.920 --> 23:05.000
Are you going to apply to colleges there?

23:06.400 --> 23:09.910
And you even said that you love me. Of course, I wouldn't.

23:10.560 --> 23:11.250
Idiot.

23:11.960 --> 23:13.790
<i>I don't believe in destiny.</i>

23:14.730 --> 23:19.880
<i>I always thought that something like that was always an overlap of coincidences.</i>

23:21.500 --> 23:26.100
<i>But if a meeting changes from a coincidence to inevitable,</i>

23:26.860 --> 23:29.150
<i>and if that is what is called as destiny,</i>

23:30.200 --> 23:33.480
<i>then I don't mind believing in it.</i>

23:34.980 --> 23:44.970
Note: Shinobu passed his exam.

23:35.550 --> 23:42.040
